   "from": "IFC2X3",
   "to": "IFC4X3",
   "line": "#5=IFCCALENDARDATE(1,1,2000);",
   "expect": "#5=IFCCALENDARDATE(1,1,2000);"
  },
  {
   "why": "an IFC2X3 or IFC4 source keeps main's behaviour for IFC4/IFC4X3 targets: its IFC2X3-only non-rooted record is written as it is, not refused (D59; BIMcollab_ARC, O-S1-BWK, 841_house)",
